)\n23. [A prebiotic Krebs cycle analog generates amino acids with H2 and NH3 over nickel - ScienceDirect](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2451929424000639)\n24. [Conversion of pyridoxal to pyridoxamine with NH3 and H2 on nickel generates a protometabolic nitrogen shuttle under serpentinizing conditions - Schlikker - 2025 - The FEBS Journal - Wiley Online Library](https://febs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1111/febs.17357)\n25. [Metals likely promoted protometabolism in early ocean alkaline hydrothermal systems](https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/sciadv.aav7848)\n26. [Quantifying Reductive Amination in Nonenzymatic Amino Acid Synthesis](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9828492/)\n27. [Prebiotic synthesis of \u03b1-amino acids and orotate from \u03b1-ketoacids potentiates transition to extant metabolic pathways](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-022-00999-w)\n28. <https://science.gsfc.nasa.gov/sed/content/uploadFiles/publication_files/Johnsonetal2008.pdf>\n29. <https://ntrs.nasa.gov/api/citations/20110023373/downloads/20110023373.pdf>\n30. [Primordial synthesis of amines and amino acids in a 1958 Miller H\\<SUB\\>2\\</SUB\\>S-rich spark discharge experiment - ADS](https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2011PNAS..108.5526P)\n31. [The Stability of Some Selected Amino Acids Under ...](https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1023/A:1006668322298.pdf)\n32. [The Role of Submarine Hydrothermal Systems in the Synthesis of Amino Acids](https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11084-008-9153-2)\n33. [Racemic amino acids from the ultraviolet photolysis of interstellar ice analogues - PubMed](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/11919623/?dopt=Abstract)\n34. [Amino acids from ultraviolet irradiation of interstellar ice analogues](https://www.nature.com/articles/416403a)\n35. [\\- Document - Amino acids from ultraviolet irradiation of interstellar ice analogues](https://go.gale.com/ps/anonymous?id=GALE%7CA187500608&issn=00280836&it=r&linkaccess=a